Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-pyqt6, python3-pil, @xlibsx@
Description: fast and lossless video cutter for mp2, mp4, mkv, av1 and more
 VideoCut is an MP2/MP4 cutter for Linux built on mpv and ffmpeg. Cutting
 is lossless by default: the target file is remuxed at the nearest
 I-frame rather than reencoded. Frame-exact cutting via reencoding is
 available as an option.
 .
 Handles avi, mkv, webm, vc1, mp2 and mp4 (program or transport stream)
 sources, including subtitle and multi audio track selection.
 .
 This package also installs VideoPlay, a companion video/audio/picture
 player built on the same mpv backend.
